credential, and reading as routine is correct. Action shape, because the link is
followed from a mail client — often on a device that never signed in — so the
button has to work standing alone.
*/ -}}
{{- define "verify_email" -}}
{{- template "chrome.shape_action" (dict "Doc" . "Accent" "#2f6fd0" "Tint" "#eaf1fc") -}}
{{- end -}}
